1
00:00:07,421 --> 00:00:08,821
(Bernadette:)Hey, Raj.

2
00:00:08,824 --> 00:00:11,494
(Raj:)Hey, I got you
a little gift.

3
00:00:11,493 --> 00:00:13,993
(Bernadette:)Oh, that's a lot
of Girl Scout Cookies.

4
00:00:13,995 --> 00:00:15,725
(Raj:)You know me.
I'm from India.

5
00:00:15,730 --> 00:00:17,830
(Raj:)I can't resist children begging.

6
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:21,370
(Raj:)So, how's it going
with the title to the house?

7
00:00:21,369 --> 00:00:22,369
(Howard:)Great, it's all done.

8
00:00:22,370 --> 00:00:23,400
(Howard:)The lawyer
tracked down my father

9
00:00:23,405 --> 00:00:24,935
(Howard:)and got him to sign it over.

10
00:00:24,940 --> 00:00:26,670
(Howard:)I didn't have to meet him,
I didn't have to talk to him,

11
00:00:26,675 --> 00:00:28,505
(Howard:)I don't even know where he is.

12
00:00:28,510 --> 00:00:31,510
(Raj:)Wow, so you're not curious
at all?

13
00:00:31,513 --> 00:00:32,343
(Howard:)Nope.

14
00:00:32,347 --> 00:00:34,077
Hm. What if he's in prison?

15
00:00:34,082 --> 00:00:35,782
(Raj:)What if he's a spy?

16
00:00:35,784 --> 00:00:38,514
(Raj:)What if he's
in a Beatles cover band?

17
00:00:39,753 --> 00:00:42,093
(Raj:)I'm just saying, if he's got
your nose and haircut,

18
00:00:42,090 --> 00:00:44,160
(Raj:)he'd make a killer Ringo.

19
00:00:46,560 --> 00:00:48,390
(Wil Wheaton:)Thanks again for
agreeing to do this.

20
00:00:48,396 --> 00:00:50,766
Oh, it's cool; I've never been
on a podcast before.

21
00:00:50,765 --> 00:00:52,635
(Leonard:)Well, you picked
a good one to start.

22
00:00:52,634 --> 00:00:54,064
(Leonard:)Wil's had lots of great guests.

23
00:00:54,069 --> 00:00:55,599
(Leonard:)Jonathan Frakes, Brent Spiner,

24
00:00:55,604 --> 00:00:58,274
(Leonard:)Michael Dorn, Gates McFadden...

25
00:00:58,273 --> 00:01:00,273
Those are Star Trek people.

26
00:01:00,275 --> 00:01:01,375
Yes!

